<p>Chehre pa Lahu Asgher e Besheer(a.s) ka malker.. Shabbir(a.s) bohat roye.. Tareekh mein mehfooz hai ye hashr ka manzar.. Shabbir(a.s) bohat roye.</p>

<p>Nahnni si wo Gardan pa jo se bhaal ka hai teer. Ye teer nahi hai dil e ehsaas pa shamsheer. Dunya mein nahi zulm ki aysi kahee'n tasweer. Mehshar hai qayamat hai ye ek baap ke ooper.. Shabbir(a.s) Bohat Roye..</p>

<p>Cheh maah ka haathon pa janaaza jo liye hain.. Eik teer se sou zakhm Dil e Sheh(a.s) pa lage hai&ntilde; Khaime ki taraf badhte kabhi Moula ruke hain.. Abbas hai na paas na Qasim hai na Akber.. Shabbir (a.s) Bohat Roye</p>

<p>Eik din mein uthaye kayee mazloom ne laashe.. The khoon mein ghalta'n sabhi pyaso'n ke janaaze. Ek raat ke dulhe ke bhi dekhe kayee tukde.. Per laasha e Asgher hai juda sabse ke jisper..Shabbir (a.s) Bohat roye</p>

<p>Se roz ke pyaase ko jo tha paani pilaana.. Wo laal huwa teere sitamger ka nashaana.. Mushkil tha ousi Laal ko phir Maa se milaana... Baacho'n mein jaha'n sheer ho wa'n khoon Dikhaker.. Shabbir (a.s) Bohat Roye..</p>

<p> Karbal ke ke hai maqtal mei'n Ajab gham ke Mazameen.. Ya'n qatl &yacute;azeedo'n ne kiya hai Dil e Yaseen.. Jalti huwi reti mein huwi Phool ki Tadfeen.. Ya'n khaak mein khud apne Kaleje ko Chupaker..Shabbir (a.s) Bohat Roye..</p>

<p>[04/07, 04:09] ...: Moula(a.s) ne banayee thi jo ek nahnni si turbat.. Chohda na layeenon ne ouse bhi hai Qayamat.. Bachche ki lahad khodke baaher kiye mayyat.. Naize pa nazar aaya jo phir ouska kata Sar ...Shabbir (a.s) Bohat Roye</p>

<p>Hur Haal mai kistarah likhu'n Dashte Bala Ka.. Sehra e Atash mein huwa Pyaaso'n ka Zabeeha... Ummat ne bohat Aale Mohummed (a.s) ko Rulaya.. Ye Nouha hai ya Qalb pa Chalta huwa khanjar.. Shabbir (a.s) Bohat Roye...</p>

